Adapt caelestia-cli 1.1.3 to Guix: allow the distribution's Python 3.12
(no Python 3.13-only APIs are used), start the shell through the packaged
`caelestia-shell' launcher on PATH instead of `qs -c caelestia', and locate
the shell's version helper relative to that launcher (or CAELESTIA_LIB_DIR)
instead of only the Arch-specific /usr/lib/caelestia.

Upstream status: Not applicable; this is Guix packaging policy.

